{"type":"TEXT","ticket":35347,"id":"e0cc964519154960"}||{"x":1580,"y":950,"value":"电路解析｜每路相同的动作链","fontSize":16,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","align":"LEFT_TOP","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":49503,"id":"939295f6c7704e9e"}||{"x":1580,"y":918,"value":"GPIO 输出高电平 → AO3400A 导通 →\nPhotoMOS 内部 LED 点亮 → 输出触点闭合。\nGPIO 为低或高阻时，10kΩ栅源下拉使触点释放。\nLED的240Ω限流对应名义约8.7mA；\n另一颗240Ω为栅极串阻，二者作用不同。","fontSize":14,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","align":"LEFT_TOP","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":35349,"id":"8f7c10a2fed948df"}||{"x":1580,"y":700,"value":"触点的意义","fontSize":16,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","align":"LEFT_TOP","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":49376,"id":"33d04abb3be54fd7"}||{"x":1580,"y":668,"value":"GAQY221S 输出为浮动、无极性触点。\n输入1脚为阳极、2脚为阴极；3/4脚为输出。\n每路两根线接被测按键两端，不接工具地。\n工具按键接口仍限制为不超过6V / 20mA。\nRon典型2Ω、最大5Ω（手册25℃条件）。","fontSize":14,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","align":"LEFT_TOP","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":35351,"id":"3cda5dd648264a3c"}||{"x":100,"y":420,"value":"动作与验证","fontSize":16,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","align":"LEFT_TOP","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":49377,"id":"cee621d7faf142dd"}||{"x":100,"y":388,"value":"五路独立控制，可实现短按、长按及组合按键。\n10ms 级按键操作面向人工动作模拟；命令时间步进不等于触点动作精度。\n实际按下 / 释放延迟及关断漏电，以器件参数和样机验证为准。\n20mA按5Ω估算触点压降约100mV，需实测确认按键识别余量。","fontSize":14,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","align":"LEFT_TOP","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
